# Second follow-up: get the rogue to the point of death with one bounded
# `play`, then poll only with bare wait/state (no further `play` call) all
# the way through a revival, to settle whether 2026-10-02-8.play's 58-second
# "stuck dead" reading was a real stall or the already-documented chained-
# play-gives-up-on-hero-null artifact.
open
tap battleground
tap map:flags
tap class:rogue:assassination
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15

play mash 100
state
shot afterplay

wait 5
state
shot p5

wait 5
state
shot p10

wait 5
state
shot p15

wait 5
state
shot p20

wait 5
state
shot p25

wait 5
state
shot p30
